From: jasullivan5 <jasulli@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:54:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Share guarded counter placement with collection effects

Reuse resolved-recipient placement for prohibition, replacements, no-op events, history and player-cap locks. Preserve collection-wide amount evaluation and aggregate resolution. Add native regression cases.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
